class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span></span></span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>长度 = 10 + 27 + 35 + 2 + 3 + 5 + 17 = 90</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>即使如此，我们可以很容易地发现，如果我们去<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Venice -&gt;  Florence</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.77777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span></span></span></span>, 最短距离15。</p>\n<p>所以，真实的最短路径为：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Venice -&gt; Florence -&gt; Naples -&gt; Sorrento -&gt; Amalfi -&gt; Pompeii -&gt; Rome</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span></span></span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>长度 = 15 + 35 + 2 + 3 + 5 + 17 = 77</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<p>因此，可以得出这样的结论：有时候，贪心算法无法找到全局最优解，因为它没有考虑所有的数据。然而，这种方法有很多实现方式（如<em>Dijkstra</em>和<em>Kruskal</em>算法），我们将在本章进一步研究。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6f10be96-7065-4aaf-ab58-10bee47ef39b","text":"## 贪心算法分析\n\n贪心算法有一些优点和缺点。\n\n### 优势\n\n- **容易设计**：为一个问题想出一个贪心的方法比通过二分搜索、动态规划等其他方式设计算法要容易。\n\n- **计算运行时间复杂度**：分析贪婪算法的运行时间一般会比其他技术（如树的遍历、图算法或分而治之）**简单**。对于分而治之方法，不清楚该技术是快还是慢？这是因为，在每次递归调用时，问题的大小**在缩减，而子问题的数量**在增加。\n\n### 劣势\n\n- **未经优化的结果**: 贪心方法的一个主要缺点是，最初，你可能会采取一个较小的步骤，导致一个大的步骤，花费最大。因此，**最终结果永远不可能被优化。**（在上面的例子中解释过。）\n\n- **正确性的证明**： 对于贪心算法来说，要理解贪心算法的正确性问题比较困难。即使有了正确的算法，也很难证明它为什么是正确的。在证明贪心算法的正确性时，需要大量的努力和耐心。此外，通过矛盾证明正确性等方法也被用于此目的。","text_html":"<h2>贪心算法分析</h2>\n<p>贪心算法有一些优点和缺点。</p>\n<h3>优势</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>容易设计</strong>：为一个问题想出一个贪心的方法比通过二分搜索、动态规划等其他方式设计算法要容易。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>计算运行时间复杂度</strong>：分析贪婪算法的运行时间一般会比其他技术（如树的遍历、图算法或分而治之）<strong>简单</strong>。对于分而治之方法，不清楚该技术是快还是慢？这是因为，在每次递归调用时，问题的大小<strong>在缩减，而子问题的数量</strong>在增加。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>劣势</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>未经优化的结果</strong>: 贪心方法的一个主要缺点是，最初，你可能会采取一个较小的步骤，导致一个大的步骤，花费最大。因此，<strong>最终结果永远不可能被优化。</strong>（在上面的例子中解释过。）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>正确性的证明</strong>： 对于贪心算法来说，要理解贪心算法的正确性问题比较困难。即使有了正确的算法，也很难证明它为什么是正确的。在证明贪心算法的正确性时，需要大量的努力和耐心。此外，通过矛盾证明正确性等方法也被用于此目的。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4b1a52dc-ca8c-4d72-a3d3-2d3cc1f2ab89","text":"---\n\n让我们从下一课的第一个贪心算法挑战开始。","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>让我们从下一课的第一个贪心算法挑战开始。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/476"}
